WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:08.220
An ordinary three D model shows you an object. A demonstration shows you how it works. Interaction Twin connects the two.

2
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:22.664
Record an everyday interaction, and turn it into a source-linked object program: the parts, their connections, and what happened. Your agent can inspect that knowledge, follow its evidence, and reuse it.

3
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:37.455
Combine a phone and charger from separate recordings. Describe a new task, then rehearse it in three D before physical validation. Show an interaction once. Keep how it works.
